<wassignedby><name>CN=Developpement Serti/O=Serti Informatique</name></wassignedby><code event="options"><lotusscript>%REM
///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
TITLE:				libSendKeys
PURPOSE:			A library to provide basic SendKeys functionality to Lotus Notes
CREATED:			Paul Carter, February 1998
MODIFIED:			Benedict Poole - 04 October 2001
EXAMPLE CALL:	
						Dim intTask As Integer
						intTask = Shell("Notepad.exe", 3)
						PushKeys "Here we go, some text 'typed' into Notepad, having launched it first!"
///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
%ENDREM
Option Public
Option Declare

</lotusscript></code><code event="declarations"><lotusscript>Private Const KEYEVENTF_EXTENDEDKEY = &amp;H1
